  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCrawford County, Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Search Crawford County\n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Cities\n Courts \n Employee Portal \n Employment\n FAQ\n \n\n Translate Language\n \n Translate\n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Home\n \n\n About\n \n \n \n\n About Crawford County\n Cemeteries\n Elected Officials\n Policies\n \n \n \n\n Board of Supervisors\n \n \n \n\n Boards and Commissions\n County Ordinances\n Meeting Agendas and Minutes\n \n \n \n\n Departments\n \n \n \n\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Community Health\n Conservation\n Emergency Management\n Recorder\n Secondary Roads\n Solid Waste and Recycling\n Treasurer\n Veteran Affairs\n Zoning\n \n \n Contact\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n \n\n Polling Places \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Election Results \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Pay Property Taxes \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Renew Vehicle Tags \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Beacon Real Estate Search \n \n \n\n \n \n\n Records Search \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nNews and Announcements\n \n\n \n\n \nJul\n \n1\n \n \n\n Draft Data Center Ordinance\n\n \n \n\n \n All News and Announcements \n\n\n\n\n \nBoard Meetings\n The Board of Supervisors meets Tuesdays at 9:00 a.m. in the Crawford County Courthouse. Agendas are posted 24 hours before scheduled meetings.\n \nUpcoming Agenda\n\n October 20, 2026 \nRecent Minutes\n\n October 6, 2026\n\n September 29, 2026\n\n All Minutes\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nCrawford County Calendar\n \n \n\n \n\n \n10/19 at 8:00am\n \nLast Day to Request Absentee Ballot to be mailed \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n10/19 at 8:00am\n \nVoter Pre-Registration Deadline \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n10/20 at 9:00am\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n10/27 at 9:00am\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n10/27 at 1:00pm\n \nVeterans Affairs Commission Monthly Meeting \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n10/30 at 8:00am\n \nAuditor's Office Open until 5 \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n10/31 at 9:00am\n \nAuditor's Office Open for Voting \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n11/3 at 7:00am\n \n2026 General Election \n \n \n \n \n\n \nLast Day to Request Absentee Ballot to be mailed\n Auditor's Office\n 1202 Broadway\n Dension, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n Monday, October 19, 2026 \n 8:00am · 5:00pm \n\n \n For More Information\n \nContact: Terri Martens \n(712) 263-6002 \ntmartens@crawfordcounty.iowa.gov \n\n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n\n \nVoter Pre-Registration Deadline\n Auditor's Office\n 1202 Broadway\n Dension, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n Monday, October 19, 2026 \n 8:00am · 5:00am \n\n \n For More Information\n \nContact: Terri Martens \n(712) 263-6002 \ntmartens@crawfordcounty.iowa.gov \n\n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n Crawford County Courthouse\n 1202 Broadway\n Dension, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n Tuesday, October 20, 2026 \n 9:00am \n\nThe Crawford County Board of Supervisors meets each Tuesday at 9:00 a.m. on the second floor of the Crawford County Courthouse.  If individuals would like to be added to the Agenda for an upcoming, regularly-scheduled meeting, please contact the Auditor's Office at (712)263-6002. Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n\n \nBoard of Supervisors Meeting\n Crawford County Courthouse\n 1202 Broadway\n Dension, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n Tuesday, October 27, 2026 \n 9:00am \n\nThe Crawford County Board of Supervisors meets each Tuesday at 9:00 a.m. on the second floor of the Crawford County Courthouse.  If individuals would like to be added to the Agenda for an upcoming, regularly-scheduled meeting, please contact the Auditor's Office at (712)263-6002. Posted by: Board of Supervisors \n\n \n \n\n \nVeterans Affairs Commission Monthly Meeting\n VA Office\n 115 North 14th Street\n Dension, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n Tuesday, October 27, 2026 \n 1:00pm \n\n \n For More Information\n \nContact: Louise Galbraith \n(712) 263-2720 \nlgalbraith@crawfordcounty.iowa.gov \n\n Posted by: Veteran Affairs \n\n \n \n\n \nAuditor's Office Open until 5\n Auditor's Office\n 1202 Broadway\n Dension, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n Friday, October 30, 2026 \n 8:00am · 5:00pm \n\n \n For More Information\n \nContact: Terri Martens \n(712) 263-6002 \ntmartens@crawfordcounty.iowa.gov \n\n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n\n \nAuditor's Office Open for Voting\n Auditor's Office\n 1202 Broadway\n Dension, IA\n Map to Event\n \n\n Saturday, October 31, 2026 \n 9:00am · 5:00pm \n\n \n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n\n \n2026 General Election\n Dension, IA\n \n\n Tuesday, November 3, 2026 \n 7:00am · 8:00pm \n\n \n Posted by: Auditor \n\n \n \n\n \nAll Events \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nAbout Crawford County\n \nCrawford County is located in west-central Iowa. It was settled in May of 1849, and the first courthouse was constructed in the fall of 1858 in the county seat of Denison. Other cities in Crawford County include Arion, Aspinwall, Buck Grove, Charter Oak, Deloit, Dow City, Kiron, Manilla, Ricketts, Schleswig, Vail, and Westside. \n \n\nThe county is administered by a Board of Supervisors who are elected and include five members. Other elected officials include the Attorney, Auditor, Recorder, Sheriff, and Treasurer. \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nCounty Courthouse\n\n 1202 Broadway\n\n Denison, IA 51442\n\n (712) 263-1280\n \n\n \nCourthouse Hours\n\n 8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m.\n\n Monday through Friday\n\n Department Hours May Vary\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Crawford County, Iowa · Title VI Nondiscrimination Notice · Privacy Policy · Terms & Conditions\n \npowered by \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n"
